# Message prefix block: CWWKO0400 - CWWKO0499

QUIESCE_TIMEOUT_OVERRIDE=CWWKO0400I: Atribut \u201e quiesceTimeout \u201c v prvku \u201eserver\u201c p\u0159episuje atribut \u201e chainQuiesceTimeout \u201c. Server ignoruje nastavenou hodnotu \u201e chainQuiesceTimeout \u201c () v d\u00e9lce {0} sekund.
# {0} is the number of seconds
QUIESCE_TIMEOUT_OVERRIDE.explanation=Je-li v souboru ` server.xml ` na prvku `server` nakonfigurov\u00e1n atribut ` quiesceTimeout `, m\u00e1 tento atribut p\u0159ednost p\u0159ed atributem ` chainQuiesceTimeout ` na prvku `channelfw`. Server ignoruje hodnotu ` chainQuiesceTimeout `.
QUIESCE_TIMEOUT_OVERRIDE.useraction=Nen\u00ed pot\u0159eba \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e1 akce. Chcete-li pou\u017e\u00edt hodnotu \u201e chainQuiesceTimeout \u201c, odstra\u0148te atribut \u201e quiesceTimeout \u201c z prvku server.
